// The per-owner Durable Object (ADR-032). Not deployed yet: no workflow deploys
// platform/. Edge Workers bind OWNER to this class by script_name from their own
// configs. This Worker binds four things: the FILES service, the files Worker, which
// itself binds no Durable Object and no service; the GATEWAY service, the model gateway,
// which binds nothing at all; the HOOKS service, the hooks Worker, which binds only its
// Worker Loader and its own two classes, where packages' hooks and code mode's VMs run;
// so none is a way to another owner's object; and PISTORE,
// the namespace of its own second class, ThreadStore (one pi store per agent thread, no
// script_name), whose objects are named only by random ids the owner object's rows hold
// and reach nothing (ADR-032 §1, amended 2026-10-30). `disable_ctx_exports` keeps the
// runtime from handing the object its own namespaces as `ctx.exports`
// (guards/config.test.ts checks this config and the files Worker's).
// `limits.subrequests` is the platform's per-invocation count of the calls the object
// makes (FILES and the gateway as subrequests; thread store RPCs on a separate "API
// requests" count it also lifts), reset as the work moves across events (live probe P1,
// `store-probe.md`: at 10,000, store calls stopped at exactly 10,000 in one alarm; at
// 1,000,000 they passed, and 32 streaming threads made 32,697 store calls in 10 minutes
// with no error); the platform's own error is the loud failure, and the object keeps no
// budget of its own. Paid accepts 1,000,000 (P1), within its 10,000,000; pinned by the
// config guard. Its one secret, ROUTING_MAC_KEY (32 random bytes, base64url, generated
// at deploy and set in the doors Worker too), is the key the sandbox tokens are MAC'd
// under (doors/src/routing-mac.ts); `secrets.required` makes a deploy without it fail.
{
  "$schema": "../node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "tinyassets-owner",
  "main": "src/index.ts",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-10-23",
  "compatibility_flags": ["nodejs_compat", "disable_ctx_exports"],
  "workers_dev": false,
  "preview_urls": false,
  "limits": { "subrequests": 1000000 },
  "secrets": { "required": ["ROUTING_MAC_KEY"] },
  "services": [
    { "binding": "FILES", "service": "tinyassets-files" },
    { "binding": "GATEWAY", "service": "tinyassets-gateway" },
    { "binding": "HOOKS", "service": "tinyassets-hooks" }
  ],
  "durable_objects": {
    "bindings": [
      { "name": "PISTORE", "class_name": "ThreadStore" }
    ]
  },
  "migrations": [
    { "tag": "v1", "new_sqlite_classes": ["OwnerDO", "ThreadStore"] }
  ]
}
